superpowers-lite-teams

A combination of:

1. superpowers-lite (this repo, ./superpowers-lite/) — itself a fork of
   obra/superpowers (https://github.com/obra/superpowers) by Jesse Vincent,
   adding a developer-picked fast/middle/full lane.

2. superpowered-teams (https://github.com/narwhalishus/superpowered-teams)
   by Bryan Yao — MIT-licensed. The two team skills
   (writing-plans-for-teams, agent-team-driven-development) and the
   code-reviewer agent were ported from that repo with minor edits to
   rewrite namespace references for in-plugin use and to wire the full
   lane through the team fitness check by default.

