Changes from upstream superpowered-teams:
- All references to `superpowers:<skill>` rewritten to bare `<skill>` names
  (those skills live inside this plugin).
- All references to `superpowered-teams:code-reviewer` rewritten to
  `superpowers-lite-teams:code-reviewer`.
- The brainstorming skill's full-lane terminal-state instruction was
  updated to invoke `writing-plans-for-teams` instead of `writing-plans`,
  matching the integration the upstream documents via claude-md-snippet.md
  but baking it directly into the skill rather than relying on a global
  CLAUDE.md edit.
- The using-superpowers skill's full-lane section calls out the teams
  default and the experimental-flag prerequisite.
